| # | Anti-Pattern | Location | Details |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Poor naming** | All 10 tests | Every test is named `Xxx_Works`, which describes nothing about expected behavior. Use `Method_Scenario_Expected` (e.g., `UpdatePrice_ValidSku_ChangesPrice`). |
